67 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (Problem and motivation: Growing volumes of CT, MRI and X-ray studies overload radiologists, causing burnout and delays in diagnostic reports. We benchmark medical Vision-Language Models that draft a radiology image description for the physician to review and approve. The AI acts as an assistant, not an autonomous diagnostician, cutting time spent on routine reporting.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
